  "reasoning": "The defendant Wang Moujia arranged for a false value-added tax (VAT) ordinary invoice (增值税普通发票) to be issued in the name of a company, with a total amount of 1,257,814.95 RMB, in exchange for a payment of 37,000 RMB. The invoice was identified as having differences from the company's genuine invoices, confirming it was falsified. This conduct constitutes the crime of falsifying VAT ordinary invoices (虚开增值税普通发票) under Chinese criminal law. No other offenses are indicated in the facts.",
  "final_answer": "[罪名]虚开增值税普通发票<eoa>"
